# Scenario cancel-signal (plan 04-20, D-21): outcome cancelled, exit 12; host-dependent (signals).
# The original diagnostic run with --self-signal-after-slices 1 --slice-ticks 4: ivs-run raises
# SIGINT itself in the cancel check after slice 1 (no racing signal, no sleep), long before the
# halt.
# expect-detail: signal step=1
ivss 1
id cancel-signal
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1.ivsc
run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
